\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Joint description of the spectra at 500 and 20~ms repetition periods. Symbols are archived frequency-stepped echo integrals. Curves show the two central-transition solutions with nonnegative underlying terms in Table~\ref {tab:fit}. Gray bands mark the masked metallic-copper probe regions. The close agreement between the two model curves illustrates the ambiguity of the weakest spectral group's asymmetry.}}{4}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
